<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="A simple tool for checking whether stated HVLS fan performance figures are plausible.">
  <title>HVLS Fan Efficiency</title>
  <style>
    :root { color-scheme: light; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; color: #232135; background: #f6f5fb; }
    body { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px 20px; line-height: 1.6; }
    h1 { color: #5636cc; }
    .card { background: white; border: 1px solid #e4e2f2; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin: 20px 0; }
    a { color: #5636cc; }
    li { margin: 10px 0; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>HVLS Fan Efficiency</h1>
    <p>A quick check of whether a manufacturer’s stated fan diameter, electrical power, and airflow appear plausible.</p>
  </header>
  <main>
    <section class="card" aria-labelledby="tools-heading">
      <h2 id="tools-heading">Project files</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="Fan%20Wire-to-Air%20Efficiency.html">Fan Wire-to-Air Efficiency calculator</a> — enter fan specifications to estimate wire-to-air efficiency.</li>
        <li><a href="README.md">About this project</a> — background and purpose.</li>
        <li><a href="LICENSE">License</a> — terms for using and sharing this project.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>

